<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cantinho da Marina</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Great+Vibes&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    color:white;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

.hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    padding:40px;
    background:
    linear-gradient(to right,
    rgba(0,0,0,.78) 0%,
    rgba(0,0,0,.72) 30%,
    rgba(0,0,0,.45) 55%,
    rgba(0,0,0,.15) 100%),
    url('/static/home_marina.jpeg');
    background-size:cover;
    background-position:center;
}

.container{
    max-width:520px;
}

.logo{
    font-family:'Great Vibes',cursive;
    font-size:72px;
    color:#ff7aa2;
    margin-bottom:0;
    line-height:1;
}

.sub{
    font-size:20px;
    color:#ffffffcc;
    margin-bottom:30px;
}

.title{
    font-size:58px;
    line-height:1.1;
    margin-bottom:20px;
    font-weight:700;
}

.desc{
    font-size:20px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:#ffffffdd;
    margin-bottom:35px;
}

.btn{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    text-decoration:none;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:20px;
    font-size:22px;
    font-weight:600;
    transition:.3s;
}

.btn:hover{
    transform:translateY(-2px);
}

.btn-primary{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4b7d,#ff84a8);
    color:white;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.btn-secondary{
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    color:white;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
    margin-bottom:30px;
}

.features{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:14px;
}

.feature{
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    padding:16px 18px;
    border-radius:16px;
    font-size:17px;
}

.secure{
    margin-top:25px;
    color:#ffffffaa;
    font-size:15px;
}

@media(max-width:768px){

    .hero{
        padding:25px;
        align-items:flex-end;
        background-position:center top;
    }

    .container{
        width:100%;
        max-width:100%;
    }

    .logo{
        font-size:58px;
    }

    .title{
        font-size:42px;
    }

    .desc{
        font-size:18px;
    }
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<section class="hero">

<div class="container">

<div class="logo">Marina</div>

<div class="sub">Cantinho da Marina</div>

<h1 class="title">
Bem-vindo ao<br>
Cantinho da Marina
</h1>

<p class="desc">
Um lugar especial para acompanhar a Marina mais de perto, conversar, ver conteúdos exclusivos e fazer parte de uma comunidade única.
</p>

<a href="/chat" class="btn btn-primary">
💖 CRIAR MINHA CONTA
</a>

<a href="/chat" class="btn btn-secondary">
👤 JÁ TENHO CONTA
</a>

<div class="features">

<div class="feature">
💬 Converse com Marina
</div>

<div class="feature">
📸 Fotos exclusivas
</div>

<div class="feature">
🎥 Vídeos exclusivos
</div>

<div class="feature">
❤️ Novidades em primeira mão
</div>

<div class="feature">
👥 Comunidade exclusiva
</div>

</div>

<div class="secure">
🔒 Ambiente seguro e privado
</div>

</div>

</section>

</body>
</html>